  "description": "The war between the kingdom of wizards and the kingdom of humans is over, but tensions still run high between the two peoples. Tan, the King's arrogant advisor, finds himself brutally transformed into a bull by a curse. The only person who can help him, Aro, the witch of the constellations, is also the person who hates him the most.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[English](https://www.webtoons.com/en/fantasy/the-witch-and-the-bull/list?title_no=1892)\n\n\n**Official Translation:**  \n[French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/fantasy/the-witch-and-the-bull/list?title_no=2039), [Spanish](https://www.webtoons.com/en/fantasy/the-witch-and-the-bull/list?title_no=1892)",
